  "implementation": [
    "After atomic process owner claim and before widgets, repository opening or report writes, read the retained report only.",
    "A passed report is observed only if isolated package/build/phase/nonce/previousRunId and valid runId/PID/entryId exactly bind the original host authorization; bytes remain unchanged without requiring a checkpoint.",
